{#
  A module's sub-page navigation — the pages[] → chip_picker mapping
  layer, written once (design.md §7.6 companion).

  Six places used to copy this exact boilerplate (finance's _nav,
  rental's management _nav, the calendar picker, staffs, rental config…),
  a seventh re-drew the row with raw btn-primary pills, and two modules
  used Bootstrap nav-pills — a third visual style for the same concept.
  One include, chip_picker underneath, so every module's sub-navigation
  looks and behaves the same (mobile truncation, "+N" bottom sheet).

  Usage:
  {% include 'partials/page_picker.html.twig' with {
      picker_id: 'finance-page-picker',
      pages: [
          { url: '/finance', label: 'Tableau de bord' },
          { url: '/finance/movements', label: 'Mouvements' },
      ],
      current_path: current_path,     -- the global; selection by equality
                                      -- or by prefix (see match_prefix)
      extra_query: '?account_id=3',   -- optional, appended to every link
      sheet_title: 'Choisir une page',-- optional
      match_prefix: true,             -- optional: a sub-route keeps its
                                      -- parent page selected
  } only %}
#}
{# Longest match wins — /finance/movements/12 selects « Mouvements »,
   never also « Tableau de bord » because it happens to sit at /finance. #}
{% set _best = '' %}
{% for page in pages %}
    {% set _matches = current_path == page.url
        or (match_prefix|default(false) and page.url != '/' and current_path starts with page.url ~ '/') %}
    {% if _matches and page.url|length > _best|length %}
        {% set _best = page.url %}
    {% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% set _items = [] %}
{% for page in pages %}
    {% set _items = _items|merge([{ id: page.url, label: page.label, selected: page.url == _best }]) %}
{% endfor %}
<div class="page-picker mb-2">
    {% include 'partials/chip_picker.html.twig' with {
        picker_id: picker_id,
        items: _items,
        mode: 'single',
        base_url: '',
        extra_query: extra_query|default(''),
        sheet_title: sheet_title|default('Choisir une page'),
        empty_text: 'Aucune page disponible.',
    } %}
</div>
